{"title":"Career Roadmap — Reporting Analyst","role":"Reporting Analyst","summary":"A Reporting Analyst collects, validates, transforms, analyzes, and presents organizational data through reports, dashboards, KPIs, and recurring business insights.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Data Science / Analytics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Reporting Analyst collects, validates, transforms, analyzes, and presents organizational data through reports, dashboards, KPIs, and recurring business insights."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits between data analysis and business intelligence. A strong Reporting Analyst does more than generate spreadsheets—they ensure that reports are accurate, automated, understandable, and useful for decision-making."},{"type":"p","text":"Core skill combination:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","Excel","Power BI","Data Visualization","Data Quality","Business Understanding","Basic Python"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical reporting areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"HR"},{"text":"Customer service"},{"text":"Supply chain"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"The career can progress toward BI Analyst, Data Analyst, Business Analyst, Analytics Engineer, BI Developer, or Analytics Lead."}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Development Focus","Typical Position"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Excel, SQL, statistics, dashboards, data cleaning"},{"text":"Reporting Intern / MIS Analyst"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Automated reporting, BI dashboards, KPI management"},{"text":"Reporting Analyst"}],[{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Advanced analytics, data modelling, BI engineering"},{"text":"Senior Reporting / BI Analyst"}],[{"text":"2037–2041"},{"text":"Analytics architecture, stakeholder management"},{"text":"BI Lead / Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"2041–2046"},{"text":"Enterprise reporting strategy and leadership"},{"text":"BI Manager / Analytics Manager"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Sc","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Data & Statistics Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Probability fundamentals"},{"text":"Data types"},{"text":"Data collection"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Basic mathematics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL fundamentals"},{"text":"Python fundamentals"},{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Start creating simple reports from datasets."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Business Intelligence"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Data transformation"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"KPI design"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to transform:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Raw Data","Cleaning","Transformation","Data Model","Analysis","Dashboard","Business Insight"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Professional Reporting"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced SQL"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"DAX"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Dashboard automation"},{"text":"KPI frameworks"},{"text":"Report scheduling"},{"text":"Business requirements"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Stakeholder communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python/pandas"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"ETL/ELT concepts"},{"text":"Cloud data fundamentals"}]}]},{"heading":"Excel","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Excel should be an advanced-level skill for a Reporting Analyst."},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"TEXT functions"},{"text":"Date functions"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Pivot Charts"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Charts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power Pivot"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Dynamic arrays"},{"text":"Automated reporting workflows"},{"text":"A professional analyst should be able to take a messy Excel workbook and convert it into a structured, refreshable reporting system."}]}]},{"heading":"SQL","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SQL is one of the most important skills for this role."},{"type":"note","label":"Target","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"HAVING"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"CTE"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"Window Functions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"INNER JOIN"},{"text":"LEFT JOIN"},{"text":"UNION"},{"text":"ROW_NUMBER"},{"text":"RANK"},{"text":"DENSE_RANK"},{"text":"LAG"},{"text":"LEAD"},{"text":"Running totals"},{"text":"Rolling averages"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example reporting workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Database","SQL Query","Data Validation","Transformation","BI Dataset","Dashboard"]}]},{"heading":"Power BI","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Power BI should become a core professional skill."},{"type":"note","label":"Target","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Power Query"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data import"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"M basics"},{"text":"Transformation"},{"text":"Merge"},{"text":"Append"},{"text":"Data type management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Unders