"Senior Reporting Analyst","BI Analyst/Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"For a more technical career:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reporting Analyst","BI Analyst","BI Developer","Analytics Engineer"]},{"type":"p","text":"For a broader analytics career:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reporting Analyst","Data Analyst","Senior Data Analyst","Analytics Specialist","Analytics Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"The key career advantage is to move beyond manual report preparation and become a professional who can extract data with SQL, transform it, build reliable data models, automate reporting, create executive-ready dashboards, and explain what the numbers mean for business decisions."}]}]}